WEBVTT

00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:33.583
MISSION 1
FAREWELL

00:00:37.583 --> 00:00:39.958
FLOWER HOUSE

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:45.125
I heard Redtooth, one of
the Seven Shadow Killers, was killed.

00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:46.208
Yeah?

00:00:47.208 --> 00:00:49.250
That vampire Redtooth?

00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:51.000
Wasn't he really tough?

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:53.375
Yeah, that's what I heard, too.

00:00:53.458 --> 00:00:57.458
They said he was defeated
on a small island by a hairstylist.

00:00:57.541 --> 00:00:58.833
A hairstylist?

00:01:00.083 --> 00:01:04.083
Did he refuse to pay for a color treatment
and get beaten to death?

00:02:31.666 --> 00:02:35.000
FIVE DAYS BEFORE SEVEN LEFT THE ISLAND

00:02:35.083 --> 00:02:37.125
5 YUAN FOR WASH & CUT
20 YUAN FOR PERM & COLOR

00:02:37.208 --> 00:02:38.750
Cut it like that.

00:02:45.791 --> 00:02:47.125
That's not easy.

00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:50.166
Didn't you say you can cut any hairstyle?

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.416
I'll try my best, then.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:53.791
Okay.

00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:06.500
Seven, let's go skateboarding.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:09.333
All right.

00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:12.583
Weird, how come it went
so smoothly this time?

00:03:33.166 --> 00:03:35.125
That's right! You didn't know?

00:03:35.208 --> 00:03:37.833
There was a big explosion
in the park last night

00:03:37.916 --> 00:03:41.666
and the 100-year-old banyan tree
was destroyed. What a shame.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.916
Look at how fast I learned it.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.041
I'm such a skateboard genius!

00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:53.208
Hey, you lost! A bet is a bet.

00:03:55.041 --> 00:03:57.916
I have a new item on my bucket list now.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.291
We'll go bungee jumping next time.

00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:04.208
No, let's go surfing first!

00:04:05.125 --> 00:04:07.041
I'll charge you for my time.

00:04:07.125 --> 00:04:10.458
Run! A ghost is coming to get me!

00:04:11.833 --> 00:04:17.041
Lee Zard, if someone bullies Cola
in the future, you have to protect her.

00:04:17.125 --> 00:04:19.416
It would be great
if she doesn't bully anyone else.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.625
Why isn't the ghost here yet?

00:04:21.708 --> 00:04:23.250
It's here.

00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:26.166
You can't catch me!

00:04:27.583 --> 00:04:33.250
Rumor has it that in Xuanwu Country,
a hairstylist killed Redtooth.

00:04:33.333 --> 00:04:37.958
They are mocking us Shadow Killers
for being overrated.

00:04:38.041 --> 00:04:41.958
Send a few killers over to check it out.

00:04:42.041 --> 00:04:43.375
REWARD

00:04:43.458 --> 00:04:45.000
<i>Increase the bounty</i>

00:04:45.083 --> 00:04:49.916
<i>and find more killers</i>
<i>to kill the people on the island.</i>

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:54.208
We need to make everyone
fear the name Shadow Killer,

00:04:54.833 --> 00:04:57.833
so no one will make fun of us anymore.

00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:01.333
Slow down, Long.

00:05:05.666 --> 00:05:06.916
YO-YO
NO.1173 ON THE KILLER RANKING LIST

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:14.750
Go to hell!

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:25.958
<i>So powerful.</i>

00:05:26.041 --> 00:05:29.041
<i>Is he the strongest one on the island?</i>

00:05:29.708 --> 00:05:31.041
<i>Better safe than sorry.</i>

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:43.041
Damn it!

00:05:53.583 --> 00:05:57.875
Did you know?
He killed Redtooth that night, I saw it.

00:05:57.958 --> 00:06:00.833
What? How could it be?
You mean that Redtooth?

00:06:00.916 --> 00:06:03.000
I'll have a bowl of meatballs, please.

00:06:04.541 --> 00:06:05.416
Hi.

00:06:07.375 --> 00:06:09.916
They left so quickly.
Did they have an upset stomach?

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:10.958
Five yuan.

00:06:20.541 --> 00:06:25.291
Have you thought about not being a killer
and selling meatballs here forever?

00:06:37.333 --> 00:06:39.125
BEEF OFFAL

00:06:39.208 --> 00:06:40.500
Let's dig in.

00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:43.041
A bowl of beef offal, please.

00:06:44.291 --> 00:06:45.250
Okay.

00:06:45.333 --> 00:06:47.500
Hey, you overpaid by six yuan.

00:06:47.583 --> 00:06:49.708
Do the Qi Controlled Scissors twice, then.

00:06:55.958 --> 00:06:57.541
You can see him one more time.

00:06:58.458 --> 00:07:00.208
Once he leaves the island,

00:07:00.791 --> 00:07:02.625
you will be enemies.

00:07:09.125 --> 00:07:12.583
<i>Hardly enough money. When will he save</i>
<i>enough to go to the Kingdom of Stern?</i>

00:07:26.333 --> 00:07:29.541
IOU 39,897 SIGNATURE

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.833
See, this hairstyle is quite fashionable.

00:07:59.833 --> 00:08:02.166
DAI BO HAIR SALON

00:08:06.166 --> 00:08:08.041
BAMBOO DRAGON
NO. 214 ON THE KILLER RANKING LIST

00:08:08.125 --> 00:08:10.083
I'm closing now, sir.

00:08:10.166 --> 00:08:12.583
Come by early tomorrow for a haircut.

00:09:11.583 --> 00:09:14.750
Setting off fireworks already?
It's not even New Year's yet.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:20.458
Do you think a 5,000 reward
for every 500 recharged is too much?

00:09:37.875 --> 00:09:39.791
<i>You are a cursed Shadow Killer.</i>

00:09:40.833 --> 00:09:43.958
<i>Killing will follow you wherever you go.</i>

00:09:45.291 --> 00:09:47.541
Internal strife is forbidden
among Shadow Killers.

00:09:48.541 --> 00:09:50.708
If they saw me kill Redtooth,

00:09:51.416 --> 00:09:53.625
I would have to kill them all as well.

00:09:55.916 --> 00:09:57.916
Therefore, you have to be

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.541
the one who killed Redtooth.

00:10:00.125 --> 00:10:04.166
Redtooth died and the organization
will dispatch more killers over here.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.375
There's only one way to save them.

00:10:07.458 --> 00:10:09.000
Put on your old clothes,

00:10:09.083 --> 00:10:11.958
leave this place, and head to Xuanwu.

00:10:13.625 --> 00:10:15.041
You knew me from before?

00:10:15.125 --> 00:10:17.500
Can you tell me what happened in the past?

00:10:20.583 --> 00:10:23.166
You are a cursed Shadow Killer.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:26.416
<i>Killing will follow you wherever you go.</i>

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:28.208
<i>This is your destiny.</i>

00:10:30.125 --> 00:10:33.583
Don't be reluctant to part with them.
That will only cause them harm.

00:10:40.708 --> 00:10:44.000
Go to Xuanwu and head to the Eagle Statue.

00:10:44.083 --> 00:10:46.541
I will make you remember your past.

00:10:53.333 --> 00:10:54.541
Why is this happening?

00:10:57.875 --> 00:10:59.166
Just go.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:02.208
I'll deal with you later
for disobeying my orders.

00:11:03.208 --> 00:11:04.833
Yes, Master.

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:48.666
No, I'm not.

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:51.583
I'm Lei Yan, Cannon Fist.

00:13:00.333 --> 00:13:04.291
Tell all the killers
that I'm going back to Xuanwu

00:13:04.375 --> 00:13:07.125
to take the leader's head myself.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:23.625
<i>Pass down my orders,</i>

00:13:23.708 --> 00:13:25.750
<i>suspend all missions temporarily.</i>

00:13:26.583 --> 00:13:28.666
<i>All killers,</i>
<i>go after this person and kill him.</i>

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:33.166
<i>Initiate the highest bounty rewards.</i>

00:13:34.041 --> 00:13:37.666
No matter what happens,
we can't let him stay alive.

00:13:39.541 --> 00:13:40.625
Yes, boss.

00:14:06.541 --> 00:14:10.125
<i>The star of disaster</i>
<i>will fall upon Xuanwu.</i>

00:15:10.666 --> 00:15:15.666
Subtitle translation by: Xiaoxiu LI
